        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo, 9 Inch Door Pull with 1 Inch Diameter</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 9\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial door pull is made from 1\" diameter aluminum bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 9\" Straight Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>Not Returnable</b>\r\n</p>",
